  "entries": [
    {
      "movingLine": 1,
      "changedTrigram": "艮",
      "text": "取象偏东北，艮列近路边、岩石旁。若最后带着物品步行或停留的经过能确认，可从那一段补问，先核朴实可查的细节。",
      "sourceRule": "艮",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:18:00.075Z",
      "textSha256": "20695af87cb18fba7d0c6ab7bf1f2d9d9b4f3677d2c9411424cfda80749afaf8"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 2,
      "changedTrigram": "乾",
      "text": "西北是变乾的传统方位，金石旁、圆器之中可作参照。若原收放依附某个容器，可先问清实际用过哪一个，再核里面与旁边。",
      "sourceRule": "乾",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:18:00.076Z",
      "textSha256": "f91c2b9c8ae1bdd7d2f5bb2430ecebd5c01c4945983e04ea59c33e6d31046ac6"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 3,
      "changedTrigram": "震",
      "text": "方位可参东方，场所看道路与闹市。若真实经过中有反复停留处，可照原时间顺序向场所方补问，前后消息宜留全。",
      "sourceRule": "震",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:18:00.076Z",
      "textSha256": "eb5d068e15ce964e76f34a7d90b6280e9ae2edecabda2d5877318b29161c306d"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 4,
      "changedTrigram": "离",
      "text": "传统方向取南，离有明窗、文书之侧的线索。疑似消息若涉及相应工作台，可先问原经手者实际所见，再请其按原物特征补看。",
      "sourceRule": "离",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:18:00.076Z",
      "textSha256": "8f12e766ea21388dbf1c02554eb03215cb51b564659d58264e411fb223207019"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 5,
      "changedTrigram": "巽",
      "text": "东南与木器之内是变巽提示。若收纳本来简朴，可先核确实用过的木箱或木柜，原有物品一层层看清，询查说实在细节即可。",
      "sourceRule": "巽",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:18:00.076Z",
      "textSha256": "6f755f090f63dbf2cf417b637d2513ce6714f3039f9c09be66a849014ed2a836"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 6,
      "changedTrigram": "坤",
      "text": "方位参西南，坤列仓储与方器。可回核最朴素、最确知的收放处，若确用过方盒或储物格，先把内部实看结果记准。",
      "sourceRule": "坤",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:18:00.076Z",
      "textSha256": "da37439b474adefc87dd3f589f17d9006450f9864b04f4abcddfa5d46a220e01"
    }
  ]
}
